{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_015Ck2PvQ1ciKAeGiiTs2qhH", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://peakvisor.com/peak/gerlachovsky-stit.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.discoveryuk.com/?p=23234207\"}, {\"url\": \"https://armchairmountaineer.com/highest-mountain-in-slovakia\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.explore-share.com/trip/climbing-mount-gerlach-slovakia\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.severovychod.sk/vylet/gerlachovsky-stit-vysoke-tatry?lang=2\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.travelslovakia.sk/mountain-guides/gerlachovsky-peak-trekking-tour-with-mountain-guide\"}, {\"url\": \"https://zaktour.gov.ua/en/?p=2012\"}, {\"url\": \"https://explorer.lbry.io/claims/3cd5cc98d0ac6d18f144c97bb9c38f667d31bdae\"}, {\"url\": \"https://zaktour.gov.ua/en/tours/mountain-highlights/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:49:54.139Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "喀尔巴阡山脉 最高峰 格尔拉赫峰", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01TASA9Du3RG3YokgnVrQdjz", "content": [{"title": "gerlachovsky stit", "url": "https://peakvisor.com/peak/gerlachovsky-stit.html"}, {"title": "www.discoveryuk.com", "url": "https://www.discoveryuk.com/?p=23234207"}, {"title": "highest mountain in slovakia", "url": "https://armchairmountaineer.com/highest-mountain-in-slovakia"}, {"title": "Explore-Share logo and link to home", "url": "https://www.explore-share.com/trip/climbing-mount-gerlach-slovakia"}, {"title": "Gerlach peak (High Tatras)", "url": "https://www.severovychod.sk/vylet/gerlachovsky-stit-vysoke-tatry?lang=2"}, {"title": "Name of the Peak: Gerlachovsky Peak (Gerlach)", "url": "https://www.travelslovakia.sk/mountain-guides/gerlachovsky-peak-trekking-tour-with-mountain-guide"}, {"title": "The highest peaks INkraїof the Carpathian Mountains", "url": "https://zaktour.gov.ua/en/?p=2012"}, {"title": "explorer.lbry.io", "url": "https://explorer.lbry.io/claims/3cd5cc98d0ac6d18f144c97bb9c38f667d31bdae"}, {"title": "The highest peaks INkraїof the Carpathian Mountains", "url": "https://zaktour.gov.ua/en/tours/mountain-highlights/"}]}, "搜索结果一致表明，喀尔巴阡山脉的最高峰是格尔拉赫峰（斯洛伐克语 Gerlachovský štít），位于斯洛伐克的高塔特拉山脉。\n\n- **位置与海拔**：该山是高塔特拉山脉、斯洛伐克乃至喀尔巴阡山脉的最高峰，通常标注海拔约2654.4米。（来源：peakvisor.com）其海拔为2,655米（8,711英尺），是斯洛伐克最高的山峰。\n- **地理位置**：它位于斯洛伐克北部，紧邻波兰边境。\n- **历史命名**：由于历次地缘政治变化，它先后属于匈牙利王国、捷克斯洛伐克和斯洛伐克，在19世纪至20世纪中叶间还有多个名称。（来源：peakvisor.com）\n- **首次测高**：有资料称，其海拔第一主峰地位是1838年由Ludovit Greiner确认的。\n- **攀登**：该山是热门攀岩目标，但因路线复杂，游客只能在有资质的山地向导陪同下登顶。\n\n需要注意：有游客网站提到乌克兰的赫瓦拉峰（Hoverla，2061米）是乌克兰喀尔巴阡山区乃至乌克兰的最高点，但它只是乌克兰境内的最高峰，并非整个喀尔巴阡山脉的最高峰。"], "durationSeconds": 7.114195375, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_015Ck2PvQ1ciKAeGiiTs2qhH", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
